sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator screen
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant C as Screw
  Note over S,C: Robot is at spot 11, Screw step.<br/>The screw supply is empty.<br/>No retry, since retrying cannot help.
  S->>C: CMD_START (spot 11)
  C-->>S: NEED_REFILL (screws)
  S->>Op: ALERT: robot stopped. Spot 11, Screw, NEED_REFILL
  Note over S: Stack light turns flashing amber, so the operator sees it from across the roof
  Note over S: Robot waits at spot 11.<br/>Nothing moves.<br/>Operator can watch the live feed.
  alt Operator can fix it
    Op->>S: RESOLVED (fixed on the robot)
    S->>C: CMD_START (resume same step)
    C-->>S: DONE
    Note over S: Spot continues with the next step
  else Operator cannot fix it (last resort)
    Op->>S: SKIP_SPOT
    Note over S: Supervisor logs the spot as skipped, then advances to the next spot
  end
